  m_Name: aa4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: aa4
  title: Zone types
  content: 'Traveling on the adventure map, the player moves between different types
    of zones connected by paths. There are many different types of zones:


    <b>Battle</b>
    - Here the player has to fight the enemy army. Sometimes the battle starts immediately,
    sometimes you can initiate it yourself, this will be displayed in the information
    window on the right when hovering;


    <b>Home</b> - This is a safe place where
    you can hire new fighters, heal the wounded, upgrade your equipment, take quests,
    and much more. Also, importantly, you can manually save the game here;


    <b>Construction</b>
    - With the necessary resources, you can erect structures or repair broken ones
    in such places. This always brings benefits, opens additional passages, brings
    resources to the player, protects against ambushes, etc.;


    <b>Recruitment
    or Rescue</b> - In such places, you can get new units or villagers into your
    ranks by fulfilling conditions;


    <b>Gathering</b> - At these points, you
    can get resources or items. Some of them regenerate over time, some do not;


    <b>Quests</b>
    - Here you can find work so as not to wander around the map aimlessly. A reward
    is always due for completing quests.


    If there is some way to <b>Interact</b>
    with the zone, a corresponding button will appear at the bottom of the screen.'
  section: 1
